Below are things to think through and ask at your annual physical.

Key background items to bring up / confirm
- Whether you have an established diagnosis of type 2 diabetes and the date of diagnosis.  
- Recent diabetes labs: HbA1c, fasting glucose or glucose log, and date of the most recent results.  
