- “I’m concerned about my diabetes management because I’m on apixaban, tapering prednisone (which may raise sugars), and my last creatinine was 320 (please note my eGFR). Could we run an A1c, BMP with eGFR, and urine albumin now? If my kidney function or A1c suggest more complex care, I’d like a referral to Phoenix Endocrinology to review medication options and risk reduction.”

